me to be, nothing out of the ordinary has occurred.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, how can you be sure? Since the second statue came to be, nothing out of the ordinary has occurred.","variant_male_record_index":"99607","variant_female_record_index":"99608","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121157008:1":{"text":"The people of Ivoryshade are so delighted with the new Deer Spirit statue. If this is just the work of a Hypogean... they'll be devastated!","source_cn":"月影乡的民众也沉醉在鹿灵再次显圣的欣喜中，如果这一切都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35B3F049F85B7C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1121157008":{"text":"The people of Ivoryshade are so delighted with the new Deer Spirit statue. If this is just the work of a Hypogean... they'll be devastated!","source_cn":"月影乡的民众也沉醉在鹿灵再次显圣的欣喜中，如果这一切都是恶魔所为……那大家该多么失望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35B3F049F85B7C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121157009:1":{"text":"I... trust you all. You would not make such claims without good reason.","source_cn":"我……我相信你们，你们不会无缘无故做出这种判断。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2DBD4E30E3972C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121157010:1":{"text":"I'll explain the situation to the authorities of Ivoryshade so that you may investigate at will.","source_cn":"我会向月影乡的祭祀说明情况，